WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Godiya ta tabbata ga Allah. Muna yabonSa, muna neman taimakonSa, kuma muna neman gafararSa.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Muna neman tsari daga Allah daga sharrin zukatanmu da kuma munanan ayyukanmu.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Duk wanda Allah Ya shiryar, babu mai iya batar da shi, kuma wanda Ya batar, babu mai iya shiryar da shi.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Ina shaida cewa babu wani abin bauta da gaskiya sai Allah Shi kaɗai, ba shi da abokin tarayya.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Kuma ina shaida cewa Muhammadu bawanSa ne kuma ManzonSa ne.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Ya ku masu imani, ku ji tsoron Allah yadda ya kamata.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Kuma kada ku mutu sai kuna Musulmi.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Ya ku masu imani, ku ji tsoron Ubangijinku wanda Ya halicce ku daga rai guda.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Kuma Ya halicci matarSa daga gare shi, Ya kuma yawaita maza da mata daga gare su.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Ku ji tsoron Allah kuma ku faɗi magana madaidaiciya.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:06.000
Zai gyara ayyukanku kuma Ya gafarta muku zunubanku.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Duk wanda ya bi Allah da ManzonSa, ya samu babban rabo.